BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:waspaa-2025-conference@scientific-conference-calendar
DTSTAMP:19700101T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20251012
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20251016
SUMMARY:WASPAA 2025 · Conference
DESCRIPTION:IEEE Workshop on Applications of Signal Processing to Audio and
  Acoustics\nStatus: confirmed\, checked 2026-10-31\nOfficial source: http
 s://www.waspaa.com/waspaa25/\nVenue Radar: https://gon-uri.github.io/venu
 e-radar/#waspaa-2025\nNotes: Archived official pages confirm Granlibakken
  Tahoe Resort\, Tahoe City\, Oct 12-15\, 2025\, fully in-person and the f
 irst WASPAA away from Mohonk Mountain House. All deadlines were 23:59 AoE
 \; the initial CMT entry (title and abstract) was mandatory\, and both pa
 per deadlines moved a week later. Papers were 4 pages plus a references p
 age\, double-blind with rebuttal. The general chairs' SPS report gives 95
  of 211 reviewed papers accepted (45%\; 246 initial) and 169 attendees\; 
 the proceedings are in IEEE Xplore. Demos were a separate 2-page track. S
 ize is an editorial estimate.
CATEGORIES:Signal Processing,Machine Learning,Multimedia Learning & Retriev
 al
URL:https://www.waspaa.com/waspaa25/
LOCATION:Tahoe City\, California\, USA
END:VEVENT
